**Request \[[Create API Key](https://ultracart.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ucdoc/pages/38688545/API+Simple+Key)\]**
```bash
curl -X POST "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/item/digital_library" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 976892e9c788c00199a693ade98001004b139b72bb4d470199a693ade9800100" \
  -d $'{
    "import_from_url": "https://spaceplace.nasa.gov/gallery-earth/en/ISS_earth.en.jpg",
    "description": "The Earth",
    "click_wrap_agreement": "By purchasing this item, you agree that it is Earth"
}'
```

**Response Headers**
```html
Status: 200 OK
X-UltraCart-Request-Id: FF2AECBB73ADD70199DEF963F080011
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
Transfer-Encoding: chunked
Date: Mon, 13 Oct 2025 19:08:30 GMT
```

**Response Body**
```json
{
    "digital_item": {
        "digital_item_oid": 235447,
        "description": "The Earth",
        "original_filename": "ISS_earth.en.jpg",
        "file_size": 68354,
        "creation_dts": "2025-10-13T15:08:30-04:00",
        "mime_type": "image/jpeg",
        "click_wrap_agreement": "By purchasing this item, you agree that it is Earth",
        "pdf_meta": {
            "custom_header": "",
            "custom_footer": ""
        }
    },
    "success": true,
    "metadata": {
        "payload_name": "digital_item"
    }
}
```
